## CC0-1.0 — Wikidata catalogs

The bright-star catalog (`stars_wikidata.bin`) and nebula catalog
(`nebulae_wikidata.bin`) in this directory are derived from Wikidata
structured data, which is dedicated to the public domain under the
Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication:

  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

See README_stars.md and README_nebulae.md for contents and how to regenerate.
Attribution to Wikidata is appreciated but not required by CC0.

## CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO — Gaia Milky Way sky

`gaia_sky_edr3_equirect.jpg` is derived from ESA/Gaia/DPAC “The colour of the
sky from Gaia’s Early Data Release 3” (cartesian / equirectangular plate).
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 IGO.

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/igo/

Acknowledgement: A. Moitinho (and Gaia DPAC).
See README_milkyway.md for projection rules and refresh (`tools/fetch_gaia_sky.py`).
